@baseUrl = http://localhost:5137

### Browse root
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/browse/
Accept: application/json

### Browse a folder by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/browse/c-programming/
Accept: application/json

### Browse a nested folder
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/browse/school_work/math
Accept: application/json

### Browse a deeply nested folder
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/browse/school_work/math/homework
Accept: application/json

### Browse a nonexistent folder (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/browse/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### Browse a path that exceeds the depth limit (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/browse/a/b/c/d/e/f/g/h/i/j/k/l/m/n/o/p/q/r/s/t/u/v/w/x/y/z/a/b/c/d/e
Accept: application/json